text:
Who are we kidding I don't go here for the fabulous food- obviously I go to see the girls in the tiny skirts!  Totally kidding! 

I love this place for the nachos, beer, and soon Boise State Football!  I have never ordered anything else here and really have no desire to.  When my honey and I are in the mood for something super casual this has become our go to spot.  

The service is totally fine- I personally don't go to sports bars expecting fabulous service so I leave content every time.  = }
